    title: "haskell System.Info rows os/arch/compilerName/compilerVersion as host_info_read, but all four are CPP constants fixed at GHC build time -- the row mints a taint source that cannot carry runtime host data"  # 6872
    status: violated  # 6872
    priority: 2  # 6872
    parent:  # 6872
    tags:  # 6872
    - catalogue  # 6872
    - taint  # 6872
