  message: "Fixed in PR #1258 (9fe0315c85). System.Info [os, arch, compilerName, compilerVersion] removed from host_info_read, and a System.Info module_completeness grant declares all its exports (incl. fullCompilerVersion) not I/O, as build-time constants. Evidence on merged dev: the catalogue no longer rows any System.Info name (test_a_build_time_constant_is_not_rowed x4) and module_io_is_enumerated('System.Info') is True; the 09-27 fixture still yields 0 System.Info chains (it did before as well: the row was inert, see the 09-27 re-verification). host_info_read controls getProgName / getCurrentTime still classify."  # ea7e
